---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service & SMS Terms and Conditions" description="Read Aura Living LLC's Terms of Service and SMS Terms and Conditions." path="/sms-terms/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Terms of Service & SMS" title="Clear terms for useful messages and services." intro="These Terms of Service and SMS Terms and Conditions explain the rules for using Aura Living LLC's website, services, and messaging program." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><article class="content-copy">
    <p><strong>Last Updated: November 23, 2026</strong></p>
    <p>Welcome to Aura Living LLC ("Aura Living," "we," "our," or "us"). By accessing or using our website (https://auralivingva.com/), online resident or applicant portals, property management services, or SMS/text messaging program, you agree to these Terms of Service ("Terms") and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, do not use our website or services.</p>

    <h2>1. Use of Website &amp; Services</h2>
    <p>Aura Living LLC provides residential and commercial property management services, including property listings, tour scheduling, online rental applications, rent payment processing, and maintenance coordination.</p>
    <h3>Eligibility</h3>
    <p>You must be at least 18 years old (or the age of majority in your jurisdiction) to submit a rental application, enter into a lease agreement, or opt into our SMS messaging program.</p>
    <h3>Accurate Information</h3>
    <p>You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information when submitting inquiries, scheduling property tours, applying for housing, or registering for resident portals.</p>
    <h3>Prohibited Conduct</h3>
    <p>You agree not to misuse our website, attempt unauthorized access to our portals or systems, interfere with site security, or submit false or fraudulent rental applications.</p>

    <h2>2. Property Listings &amp; Equal Housing Opportunity</h2>
    <p>Property descriptions, availability dates, rental rates, floor plans, and amenities listed on https://auralivingva.com/ are subject to change without notice and do not constitute a binding lease offer. A binding tenancy is established only upon full execution of a written lease agreement.</p>
    <p>Aura Living LLC operates in compliance with the federal Fair Housing Act, the Virginia Fair Housing Law, and applicable state/local non-discrimination ordinances.</p>

    <h2>3. SMS / Text Messaging Terms &amp; Conditions (10DLC)</h2>
    <p>Aura Living LLC sends transactional, operational, and customer-care SMS/text messages to prospective tenants, current residents, property owners, and vendors. Message types include property tour confirmations/reminders/rescheduling, rental application status and document requests, maintenance work order confirmations/technician windows/completion alerts, lease renewal reminders/rent payment notifications/urgent property or community safety alerts, and responses to direct customer service inquiries.</p>
    <p>Users opt in by providing a mobile number via website forms, resident/applicant portals, tour scheduling tools, or written agreements and checking the designated SMS consent checkbox (or texting a designated keyword to initiate communication). Consent is not a condition of applying for housing, entering into a lease, or purchasing property-management services.</p>
    <p>Message frequency varies. Aura Living does not charge a separate SMS fee; carrier message/data rates may apply. Reply STOP, UNSUBSCRIBE, CANCEL, END, or QUIT to opt out; one final confirmation may be sent and no further messages will be sent unless the user opts back in or initiates a new conversation. Reply HELP or contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> / <a href="tel:+17038284040">{site.phone}</a> for help.</p>
    <p>Carriers, including AT&amp;T, T-Mobile, Verizon, and regional carriers, are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery depends on the wireless provider and network availability.</p>
    <p>No mobile information, SMS opt-in data, or phone numbers collected for SMS purposes will be shared, sold, rented, or disclosed to third parties or affiliates for marketing/promotional purposes. Necessary sharing with subcontractors, customer-service platforms, SMS gateways, or telecom providers is permitted solely to deliver the messaging service and not for secondary marketing.</p>

    <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>All content on auralivingva.com, including text, logos, graphics, photographs, property descriptions, and software, is the property of Aura Living LLC or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. Do not reproduce or exploit content without written permission.</p>

    <h2>5. Third-Party Links &amp; Portals</h2>
    <p>The website may link to tenant-screening services, online payment gateways, or resident portal providers. Aura Living LLC is not responsible for external sites; their own terms and privacy policies apply.</p>

    <h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties &amp; Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>The website and SMS services are provided “as is” and “as available” without express or implied warranties. To the fullest extent permitted by applicable Virginia and federal law, Aura Living LLC, its members, employees, and agents are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from use or inability to use the website or SMS services.</p>

    <h2>7. Governing Law &amp; Dispute Resolution</h2>
    <p>These Terms are governed by Virginia law. Legal actions shall be brought exclusively in state or federal courts located within Virginia.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We may modify these Terms. Updates will be posted with a revised Last Updated date; continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact Information</h2>
    <p><strong>Aura Living LLC</strong><br />
      Mailing Address: {site.address}<br />
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a><br />
      Phone: <a href="tel:+17038284040">{site.phone}</a><br />
      Website: <a href={site.url}>{site.url}/</a>
    </p>
  </article><aside class="side-card"><h2>Need help?</h2><p>For SMS assistance, reply HELP to a message or use the official contact details in Section 9.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Contact Aura Living LLC</a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
